<div class="ht-editor ht-form-editor ht-body-editor">
  <p class="hint">Format it like a journal page: headings, bold, italic, lists, tables, dividers and links are in the toolbar. Players see it this way on the datapad.</p>
  <div class="ht-pm-wrap editor prosemirror"><div class="ht-pm-target editor-content">{{{html}}}</div></div>
  <footer class="ht-fe-foot">
    <span class="ht-grow"></span>
    <button type="button" data-action="cancelBody">Cancel</button>
    <button type="button" class="ht-primary" data-action="saveBody"><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Done</button>
  </footer>
</div>
